Troubleshooting Tips
Common Issues and Solutions
Issue 1: Connection Timeout

Symptom: Routes fail with connection timeout errors
Solution: Increase timeout values in HTTP component configuration:
.to("https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts/1?connectTimeout=10000&socketTimeout=10000")
Issue 2: JSON Parsing Errors

Symptom: Unmarshalling fails with JSON parsing exceptions
Solution: Add error handling and validate JSON structure:
.doTry()
    .unmarshal().json(JsonLibrary.Jackson, Post.class)
.doCatch(Exception.class)
    .log("JSON parsing failed: ${exception.message}")
    .setBody(constant("Invalid JSON received"))
.end()
Issue 3: File Permission Issues

Symptom: Cannot write to output directory
Solution: Check and fix directory permissions:
chmod 755 src/main/resources/output/
Issue 4: Maven Dependency Issues

Symptom: ClassNotFoundException for Camel components
Solution: Verify all dependencies are correctly added to pom.xml and run:
mvn clean install
